WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.360
You said you were releasing 
humanity from all control.

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:06.660
What are you fighting?

00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:09.830
Tell us what you want.

00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:14.310
If you're really fighting for someone 
else's sake, we can work together.

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:16.260
Work together?

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:17.850
The arrogance.

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:22.790
We will use the power of the gods 
to break the curse of Balal.

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:27.920
The power of the gods? The curse of Balal?

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:31.040
We'll take control of the lunar ruins.

00:02:21.400 --> 00:02:23.700
The lunar ruins?

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:27.970
The incomplete world order, where humans
 hold power over other humans,

00:02:27.970 --> 00:02:32.710
is a result of disharmony created by 
the Curse of Balal carved into our souls.

00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:38.770
And making the imperfect perfect 
is Saint Germain's goal.

00:02:39.180 --> 00:02:42.480
It is the ideology of the Bavarian Illuminati.

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:47.230
Taking control of the administrative 
rights to the lunar ruins

00:02:47.230 --> 00:02:51.710
requires a power equal to the old 
rulers, which were called gods.

00:02:51.710 --> 00:02:57.150
That's why we've done rituals all 
over the world, including Valverde.

00:02:57.150 --> 00:03:01.390
But that doesn't give you the 
right to sacrifice others.

00:03:01.390 --> 00:03:02.750
We're not sacrificing them.

00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:05.300
The blood that was shed, 
the lives that were lived,

00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:07.130
are the cornerstones of the revolution!

00:03:11.240 --> 00:03:17.170
<i>The wrath of heaven falls 
like the roar of a dragon</i>

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:16.500
<b>Soaring Phoenix's Slash</b>

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:21.990
<i>The sky laughs in exasperation 
at the deeds of man</i>

00:03:21.990 --> 00:03:23.850
<i>Those who...</i>

00:03:38.510 --> 00:03:40.180
How about this?

00:03:42.020 --> 00:03:44.450
This is payback from before!

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:46.550
It's huge!

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:53.670
Shirabe!

00:03:58.200 --> 00:03:59.430
At this rate...

00:03:59.730 --> 00:04:02.120
Then, let's do it! Shirabe!

00:04:02.650 --> 00:04:04.330
Ignite Module!

00:04:04.330 --> 00:04:05.230
Draw Swords!

00:04:05.230 --> 00:04:06.140
Death!

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:11.110
No! The Philosopher's Stone overrides 
the power of Dáinsleif...

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:23.560
They're being reckless.

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:25.520
As long as they can't hit us...

00:04:26.060 --> 00:04:28.560
Must die!

00:04:31.190 --> 00:04:33.840
Your easygoing ways are 
proof your heads are empty!

00:04:39.740 --> 00:04:41.770
Tsukuyomi! Akatsuki!

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:48.020
For the sake of tomorrow, 
my bullets will not hesitate.

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:50.570
Why? Why?

00:04:50.570 --> 00:04:52.110
You'd never understand.

00:04:52.630 --> 00:04:55.160
But that is the Curse of Balal.

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:57.220
The chain that binds mankind.

00:04:58.890 --> 00:05:04.080
But even so, people have hands to hold 
each other's, not to cause pain!

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:05.700
Hold each other's?

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:09.940
The words of someone who's never 
been oppressed for an unfair reason!

00:05:14.700 --> 00:05:17.870
I don't understand what you're saying at all!

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:20.800
What?

00:05:30.920 --> 00:05:32.200
But, even so...

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:34.700
Murderer

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:34.700
Thief

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:34.700
Why did only
 you survive

00:05:33.290 --> 00:05:37.050
I'm sure I can understand how you feel.

00:05:37.430 --> 00:05:44.520
You can't make a tomorrow where no one 
hurts anyone by hurting someone today.

00:05:44.880 --> 00:05:46.190
You...

00:05:51.650 --> 00:05:53.440
You're making me feel all funny!

00:05:58.230 --> 00:05:59.550
Oh, dear.

00:05:59.550 --> 00:06:00.650
Over here!

00:06:12.210 --> 00:06:15.920
I know we can't reach the heavens together.

00:06:17.760 --> 00:06:20.010
But even if we can't...

00:06:20.010 --> 00:06:21.300
Don't be so arrogant!

00:06:22.530 --> 00:06:27.120
The hand that opens tomorrow is 
always a fist clenched in wrath!

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:31.820
There's no more sense in talking.

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:34.040
We'll finish this later, Symphogears.

00:06:35.530 --> 00:06:37.710
Abandoning the mission now?

00:06:38.240 --> 00:06:40.320
What are you doing, Saint Germain?

00:06:40.320 --> 00:06:41.860
It's my fault?

00:06:41.860 --> 00:06:44.310
If so, sorry! Super sorry!

00:06:53.730 --> 00:06:57.940
The Bavarian Illuminati's goal is 
to take control of the lunar ruins.

00:06:58.340 --> 00:07:01.760
They need what they call the
 "Power of the Gods"  in order to do it.

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:05.020
And they're trying to transmute 
life energy into that?

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:10.860
Even if that's true, if a single strike from 
Hibiki can destroy it, that can't be it.

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:15.040
It's probably much more vast...

00:07:15.040 --> 00:07:19.780
Where and how would you get 
that level of life energy...

00:07:20.350 --> 00:07:21.930
Could it be the ley lines?

00:07:21.930 --> 00:07:23.110
What?

00:07:24.300 --> 00:07:28.080
The ley lines that Carol used 
when dissecting the world.

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:32.620
If they can extract the planet's 
energy through the ley lines...

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:37.460
The Bavarian Illuminati was involved in 
the creation of the Château de Tiffauges.

00:07:37.870 --> 00:07:40.160
It's unlikely to just be a coincidence.

00:07:40.570 --> 00:07:46.350
I'll contact the Jinja Honchou and get 
cooperation from all the ley line observatories.

00:07:46.350 --> 00:07:47.510
Good.

00:07:47.800 --> 00:07:50.400
Now it's just a question of 
how the Wielders are doing.

00:07:50.930 --> 00:07:53.860
The LiNKER worked fine, it seems, but...

00:07:58.310 --> 00:07:59.690
I'm sorry.

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:05.700
You two risked your lives to 
create the LiNKER, but we...

00:08:07.090 --> 00:08:09.020
I'm the same.

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:12.860
I thought that, as long as I could fight,
 things would work out.

00:08:13.320 --> 00:08:15.300
But I was naïve.

00:08:16.100 --> 00:08:17.260
Damn it!

00:08:17.880 --> 00:08:19.390
What the hell?

00:08:21.510 --> 00:08:24.530
The Philosopher's Stone cancels out
 their Ignite Modules.

00:08:24.530 --> 00:08:27.710
We need to find a way to 
deal with that. Fast.

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:29.730
What's Elfnein-kun doing?

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:34.580
I told her to take care of herself, 
but she's still working in the lab...

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:43.320
I believed you'd be okay, but the news never 
gives any details, so I was worried.

00:08:43.800 --> 00:08:48.920
Will this do? Now add the milk...

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:51.330
Today's my comeback after last time!

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:54.550
I've actually been studying 
how to make it in secret!

00:08:55.270 --> 00:08:56.390
Miku...

00:08:57.870 --> 00:09:03.770
If you want something, does that mean 
letting go of something else?

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:11.340
Is it selfish wanting to just 
make everything work out?

00:09:13.590 --> 00:09:16.690
I like it when you're selfish, Hibiki.

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:24.740
<i>When I was trying to improve my 
sprinting times in middle school,</i>

00:09:24.740 --> 00:09:27.100
<i>everybody around me was a rival.</i>

00:09:27.100 --> 00:09:30.790
<i>It wasn't easy to think about anybody else.</i>

00:09:42.570 --> 00:09:45.040
Just a little more...

00:09:46.590 --> 00:09:50.040
Hibiki! What are you doing? 
That's dangerous!

00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:52.350
I'm just fine!

00:09:59.260 --> 00:10:00.800
Thank you, miss!

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:02.030
Thanks.

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:03.590
Thank you so much.

00:10:04.980 --> 00:10:06.360
Are you okay?

00:10:06.360 --> 00:10:09.330
Yeah. There was a crying kid.

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:11.320
So I guess I worked a little too hard.

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:14.630
Get Out      Thief     Murderer

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:21.360
<i>Even though she actually wanted 
to cry more than anyone,</i>

00:10:21.360 --> 00:10:23.380
<i>for someone to save her...</i>

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:27.780
<i>But she still did reckless 
things trying to help others.</i>

00:10:28.870 --> 00:10:32.360
<i>I didn't want to see anyone's back then...</i>

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:37.950
<i>But it was different when I saw her 
kind back as she walked ahead of me.</i>

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:42.120
<i>On that day, I realized 
that I didn't want</i>

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:46.000
<i>to run in front of someone else, 
but to walk beside them forever...</i>

00:10:47.220 --> 00:10:52.340
<i>And when I graduated middle school, 
I quit the track team.</i>

00:10:53.950 --> 00:10:58.440
<i>I'll never tell anyone how 
I really feel, I'm sure.</i>

00:10:58.930 --> 00:11:02.290
<i>But I wanted to give form to my feelings,</i>

00:11:02.290 --> 00:11:05.150
<i>so I decided I wanted to 
learn the piano someday.</i>

00:11:07.080 --> 00:11:08.980
Thank you for the meal.

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:10.940
You're welcome.

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:21.880
Hey, Hibiki.

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:27.890
If doing what you want to do
 makes you selfish...

00:11:27.890 --> 00:11:30.840
I'll support you in being selfish.

00:11:31.490 --> 00:11:36.920
I'm sure your selfishness is a hand 
being held out to people in trouble.

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:38.240
Miku...

00:11:39.200 --> 00:11:40.510
Thank you!

00:11:44.050 --> 00:11:48.520
I've gathered all the books I could find 
on heretical technology, but...

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:52.140
If there's anything else you need, 
anything at all, just ask.

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:54.210
Okay. Thank you...

00:11:54.910 --> 00:11:56.030
Are you okay?

00:11:56.780 --> 00:11:58.760
Are you sure you're not working too hard?

00:11:58.760 --> 00:12:00.780
I'm sorry.

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:04.960
But... this body was given to me by Carol.

00:12:04.960 --> 00:12:06.780
The two of us are one.

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:09.200
So I need to work hard 
enough for both of us.

00:12:12.990 --> 00:12:13.990
What is it?

00:12:14.970 --> 00:12:16.220
This is...

00:12:22.610 --> 00:12:25.580
I did say that, yes.

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:28.420
I told you to destroy the Symphogears.

00:12:28.420 --> 00:12:30.340
I'm sorry.

00:12:31.110 --> 00:12:33.750
You got in our way when it was going well.

00:12:33.750 --> 00:12:35.180
I don't like you.

00:12:35.180 --> 00:12:38.380
I can hear you, you third-rate alchemists!

00:12:38.380 --> 00:12:40.910
I won't let you insult Adam!

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:44.830
At last, the Aspect has been revealed to us.

00:12:45.340 --> 00:12:48.120
In the horoscope Tiki created.

00:12:49.360 --> 00:12:52.370
Then we do the ritual to place the altar.

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:58.280
Shall we grab the power of 
the gods with our own hands?

00:12:59.720 --> 00:13:01.670
Tiki's flying!

00:13:02.550 --> 00:13:05.260
For the creation of a perfect world...

00:13:10.360 --> 00:13:11.610
I don't like that guy at all.

00:13:12.280 --> 00:13:16.950
It's annoying that he runs the Illuminati.

00:13:16.950 --> 00:13:18.170
Yes.

00:13:18.630 --> 00:13:23.900
But it's not him or the Illuminati 
that we're following.

00:13:29.670 --> 00:13:30.940
Both of you...

00:13:31.980 --> 00:13:35.630
If we don't want Adam to act so stuck-up,

00:13:35.630 --> 00:13:37.510
we're going to need to get serious.

00:13:37.510 --> 00:13:42.280
But I need to start on the 
ceremony to place the altar.

00:13:43.030 --> 00:13:48.040
Then leave the destruction
 of the Symphogears to us.

00:13:48.530 --> 00:13:49.570
What is it?

00:13:49.570 --> 00:13:51.980
This garbage was left over after

00:13:51.980 --> 00:13:57.180
Hibiki fused with the Gungnir and 
became a living nuclear reactor.

00:13:57.770 --> 00:14:00.580
Oh, that scab?

00:14:00.580 --> 00:14:04.940
But I was told it had no 
significant power of its own.

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:09.910
The Philosopher's Stone was created by viewing 
the entire world as a single great lifeform.

00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:15.340
But this garbage was created from 
a single, tiny life: Hibiki-san.

00:14:15.340 --> 00:14:18.490
In other words, the two of were created
 in the complete opposite manner.

00:14:18.810 --> 00:14:21.990
The project to strengthen the 
Symphogears that I'm proposing

00:14:21.990 --> 00:14:25.480
uses the exact opposite 
properties of this garbage

00:14:25.480 --> 00:14:29.000
to nullify the powers of 
the Philosopher's Stone.

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:32.060
In other words, it's a 
pair-annihilation barrier coating!

00:14:32.400 --> 00:14:33.680
Indeed.

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:37.690
This answer was derived from the fundamental

00:14:37.690 --> 00:14:40.650
alchemical principal of the 
macrocosms and microcosms.

00:14:41.310 --> 00:14:43.820
I wish somebody would explain...

00:14:43.820 --> 00:14:46.980
I doubt we'd understand the explanation, though.

00:14:46.980 --> 00:14:53.460
If that stuff came out of a certain dummy, 
it's got to be the Fool's Stone, then.

00:14:53.460 --> 00:14:56.330
"Fool" is mean, Chris-chan.

00:14:57.140 --> 00:15:01.280
I see. The Fool's Stone, to stand
 against the Philosopher's Stone.

00:15:02.050 --> 00:15:04.150
You, too, Master?

00:15:04.770 --> 00:15:07.380
So, where is this stone?

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:11.460
After it was investigated, 
it was deemed an unnecessary sample

00:15:11.460 --> 00:15:14.400
and hidden in the Undersea Dragon's Palace 
in the depths of the ocean.

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:24.300
Finding the Fool's Stone will be like finding 
a single grain of gold from within the mud.

00:15:24.830 --> 00:15:27.030
It'll take time, but I'm counting on you.

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:28.120
Roger.

00:15:31.570 --> 00:15:32.960
Oh, dear...

00:15:32.960 --> 00:15:36.030
It's squished more than I thought.

00:15:40.730 --> 00:15:41.800
<i>Then...</i>

00:15:45.100 --> 00:15:46.760
<i>And then in Valverde...</i>

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:52.770
<i>Looking back, there may have been a 
more cool-headed way to do things.</i>

00:16:09.910 --> 00:16:12.810
We can really use these to find it, right?

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:21.430
Alca-Noise signals detected!

00:16:21.430 --> 00:16:23.370
Narrowing down coordinates.

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:24.360
The enemy is...

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:27.170
Almost right above us?

00:16:27.570 --> 00:16:28.430
Don't tell me...

00:16:28.430 --> 00:16:30.470
They waited for us to leave?

00:16:30.890 --> 00:16:38.900
<i>Zeios Igalima raizen tron.</i>

00:17:10.810 --> 00:17:16.750
<i>A happy-go-lucky girl from the depths 
of hell, scaring demons dead pale</i>

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:15.550
<b>α Style 100 Samsara</b>

00:17:16.750 --> 00:17:21.510
<i>Waving around my scythe around</i>

00:17:23.240 --> 00:17:25.520
It's okay! Hurry up and evacuate.

00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:28.690
You really think it's okay, huh?

00:17:28.690 --> 00:17:30.290
You easygoing girl!

00:17:30.290 --> 00:17:32.140
Who are you calling easygoing?

00:17:32.140 --> 00:17:33.920
You, of course!

00:17:40.270 --> 00:17:42.580
Oh, my. Whose fault was that?

00:17:43.100 --> 00:17:46.200
<i>A melody of love...</i>

00:17:50.020 --> 00:17:51.130
Kiri-chan! Chris—

00:17:54.590 --> 00:17:59.850
Without Dáinsleif, 
the Symphogears are too easy.

00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:02.430
We'll destroy you here.

00:18:03.160 --> 00:18:05.540
They're trying to destroy the Symphogears?

00:18:05.540 --> 00:18:07.550
Not the Fool's Stone?

00:18:07.550 --> 00:18:10.180
Then, let's go all out!

00:18:11.740 --> 00:18:13.940
Go!

00:18:14.640 --> 00:18:16.980
The surface facility is under attack!

00:18:16.980 --> 00:18:17.860
What?

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:19.640
We'll surface now!

00:18:19.640 --> 00:18:21.830
<i>Keep working!</i>

00:18:22.360 --> 00:18:25.400
<i>They don't seem to know 
about the Fool's Stone.</i>

00:18:26.720 --> 00:18:30.740
If they discover the recovery efforts, 
they may try to interrupt them.

00:18:30.740 --> 00:18:33.980
<i>But against the Philosopher's Stone...</i>

00:18:33.980 --> 00:18:38.500
Unison. If we can combine Kirika-san 
and Shirabe-san's songs...

00:18:38.920 --> 00:18:41.270
They can fight without 
needing to draw swords!

00:18:41.880 --> 00:18:45.030
Then, I'll open a path for them!

00:18:46.710 --> 00:18:48.670
Guts!

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:02.320
<i>Close enough for a kiss!</i>

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:05.450
<i>But my lips aren't that easy to steal.</i>

00:19:06.870 --> 00:19:08.110
Be still my beating heart!

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:15.880
Okay, let's do it!

00:19:16.390 --> 00:19:17.630
Kiri-chan!

00:19:20.820 --> 00:19:26.720
<i>A happy-go-lucky girl from the depths 
of hell, scaring demons dead pale</i>

00:19:26.720 --> 00:19:32.010
<i>Waving around my scythe around</i>

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:29.890
<b>Calamity Ring Tinkerbell</b>

00:19:32.010 --> 00:19:41.880
<i>Don't mess with me because I'm small. 
My saws are the most painful, understand?</i>

00:19:42.990 --> 00:19:48.710
<i>For some reason my heart 
refuses to synchronize</i>

00:19:43.710 --> 00:19:48.960
<i>I want to save the "Why?" in my heart</i>

00:19:47.920 --> 00:19:51.260
Shirabe-chan and Kirika-chan's phonic 
gain is increasing exponentially.

00:19:48.710 --> 00:19:56.310
<i>but there's a warm melody of 
love that's just for the two of us</i>

00:19:51.240 --> 00:19:56.680
<i>but there's a melody of love
that gives you warmth
that's just for the two of us</i>

00:19:51.260 --> 00:19:52.990
With this level of power...

00:19:56.950 --> 00:20:02.950
<i>The moon can never shine on its own</i>

00:19:56.950 --> 00:20:02.950
<i>What can I do to be a sun 
that protects the moon?</i>

00:19:57.840 --> 00:20:01.210
We were nothing but worthless frauds...

00:20:01.980 --> 00:20:08.480
But Saint Germain gave us perfect bodies, 
true wisdom, and an ideal!

00:20:02.950 --> 00:20:08.370
<i>The two of us are one</i>

00:20:08.370 --> 00:20:14.430
<i>Bring our bonds together with passion 
Now let them overlap...</i>

00:20:08.370 --> 00:20:14.430
<i>Let's bring our bonds together and let them overlap</i>

00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:13.060
So for her sake... we can't lose!

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:14.440
Prelati?

00:20:14.430 --> 00:20:22.490
<i>Let's support each other in 
overwhelming love and get stronger</i>

00:20:17.390 --> 00:20:22.480
You can't get to your ideals 
with just fun, feel-good things.

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:28.040
<i>Bring our bonds together with passion
Now let them overlap...</i>

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:28.040
<i>Let's bring our bonds together and let them overlap</i>

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:39.250
<i>Let's support each other in 
overwhelming love and get stronger</i>

00:20:30.950 --> 00:20:32.540
<b>Forbidden Union Type β Zababa Sun Moon</b>

00:20:35.360 --> 00:20:37.040
For my ideals!

00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:42.260
What?

00:20:48.070 --> 00:20:49.950
That's enough for today.

00:20:59.900 --> 00:21:02.190
Our hands overlap...

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:04.340
And we'll never let go.

00:21:04.860 --> 00:21:07.440
Get a room, you two.

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:09.570
They did it.

00:21:09.570 --> 00:21:12.260
Yeah. For today.

00:21:21.130 --> 00:21:26.120
Seems like the ritual to place 
the altar is going well.

00:21:26.120 --> 00:21:27.170
Yes.

00:21:27.170 --> 00:21:28.490
But...

00:21:28.490 --> 00:21:33.310
We lack the life energy needed to establish 
the greater central control altar.

00:21:33.980 --> 00:21:36.930
Then use a sacrifice, perhaps.

00:21:37.850 --> 00:21:40.310
One of those two.

00:21:41.030 --> 00:21:46.220
That should make up the difference nicely...

00:21:46.220 --> 00:21:50.280
The life energy that comes 
from a perfect body.

00:21:50.740 --> 00:21:55.660
Director... How inhuman can you be?

00:21:55.660 --> 00:22:00.140
I think it's time for you 
to choose your justice.
